<title>SPAIN: Spain's Ferrovial 1996 net doubles to 8.1 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain's Ferrovial 1996 net doubles to 8.1 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish construction firm Ferrovial posted 1996 net profit of 8.1 billion pesetas, more than double 1995's figure, the company said on Monday.</p>
<p>In 1996 Ferrovial bought a 24.7 percent of parking firm Estacionamentos Subterraneos (Essa), and made total investments of 33 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>Ferrovial had total 1996 turnover of 280 billion pesetas, up 30 percent, while the order book at the end of the year was 412 billion pesetas. Of this figure, 64 billion are foreign orders.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
